            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5892127?u=20a6c16972e912ed6515cb106393c62659f203de&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Patches the following packages to point to .NET 8.0:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">alttpr-opentracker</code> (issue upstream: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2746631073\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/trippsc2/OpenTracker/issues/93\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/trippsc2/OpenTracker/issues/93/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/trippsc2/OpenTracker/issues/93\">trippsc2/OpenTracker#93</a>)</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">am2rlauncher</code> (issue upstream: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2746634147\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/AM2R-Community-Developers/AM2RLauncher/issues/93\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/AM2R-Community-Developers/AM2RLauncher/issues/93/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/AM2R-Community-Developers/AM2RLauncher/issues/93\">AM2R-Community-Developers/AM2RLauncher#93</a>)</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">avalonia-ilspy</code>: (issue upstream: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2746751627\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/icsharpcode/AvaloniaILSpy/issues/151\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/icsharpcode/AvaloniaILSpy/issues/151/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/icsharpcode/AvaloniaILSpy/issues/151\">icsharpcode/AvaloniaILSpy#151</a>)</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">clr-loader</code> (no issue upstream because they're just sample projects and not actually built)</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">dafny</code> (issue upstream: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2069005729\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/dafny-lang/dafny/issues/4948\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/dafny-lang/dafny/issues/4948/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/dafny-lang/dafny/issues/4948\">dafny-lang/dafny#4948</a>)</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">formula</code> (issue upstream: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2746638675\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/VUISIS/formula-dotnet/issues/42\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/VUISIS/formula-dotnet/issues/42/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/VUISIS/formula-dotnet/issues/42\">VUISIS/formula-dotnet#42</a>)</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">inklecate</code> (issue upstream: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2746620806\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/inkle/ink/issues/922\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/inkle/ink/issues/922/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/inkle/ink/issues/922\">inkle/ink#922</a>)</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">knossosnet</code> (issue upstream: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2746642029\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/KnossosNET/Knossos.NET/issues/259\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/KnossosNET/Knossos.NET/issues/259/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/KnossosNET/Knossos.NET/issues/259\">KnossosNET/Knossos.NET#259</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The following have been upgraded to a new version that has support for a newer .NET:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">gh-gei</code> (first version with .NET 8 support is v1.10.1, but might as well upgrade to latest while I'm at it):\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-gei/releases/tag/v1.10.0\">https://github.com/github/gh-gei/releases/tag/v1.10.0</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-gei/releases/tag/v1.10.1\">https://github.com/github/gh-gei/releases/tag/v1.10.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-gei/releases/tag/v1.11.0\">https://github.com/github/gh-gei/releases/tag/v1.11.0</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">ilspycmd</code> (upgrade to preview version was needed because it's the only one that has .NET 8 support):\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v8.1\">https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v8.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v8.1.1\">https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v8.1.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v8.2\">https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v8.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v9.0-preview1\">https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v9.0-preview1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v9.0-preview2\">https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v9.0-preview2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v9.0-preview3\">https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v9.0-preview3</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Part of <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2403468389\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/326335\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/326335/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/326335\">#326335</a>.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Things done</h2>\n\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li>Built on platform(s)\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked=\"\"> x86_64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\"> aarch64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\"> x86_64-darwin</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\"> aarch64-darwin</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>For non-Linux: Is sandboxing enabled in <code class=\"notranslate\">nix.conf</code>? (See <a href=\"https://nixos.org/manual/nix/stable/command-ref/conf-file.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nix manual</a>)\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\"> <code class=\"notranslate\">sandbox = relaxed</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\"> <code class=\"notranslate\">sandbox = true</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\"> Tested, as applicable:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://nixos.org/manual/nixos/unstable/index.html#sec-nixos-tests\" rel=\"nofollow\">NixOS test(s)</a> (look inside <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/nixos/tests\">nixos/tests</a>)</li>\n<li>and/or <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md#package-tests\">package tests</a></li>\n<li>or, for functions and \"core\" functionality, tests in <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/lib/tests\">lib/tests</a> or <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/test\">pkgs/test</a></li>\n<li>made sure NixOS tests are <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md#linking-nixos-module-tests-to-a-package\">linked</a> to the relevant packages</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked=\"\"> Tested compilation of all packages that depend on this change using <code class=\"notranslate\">nix-shell -p nixpkgs-review --run \"nixpkgs-review rev HEAD\"</code>. Note: all changes have to be committed, also see <a href=\"https://github.com/Mic92/nixpkgs-review#usage\">nixpkgs-review usage</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked=\"\"> Tested basic functionality of all binary files (usually in <code class=\"notranslate\">./result/bin/</code>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/nixos/doc/manual/release-notes/rl-2505.section.md\">25.05 Release Notes</a> (or backporting <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/nixos/doc/manual/release-notes/rl-2411.section.md\">24.11</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/nixos/doc/manual/release-notes/rl-2505.section.md\">25.05</a> Release notes)\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\"> (Package updates) Added a release notes entry if the change is major or breaking</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\"> (Module updates) Added a release notes entry if the change is significant</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\"> (Module addition) Added a release notes entry if adding a new NixOS module</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked=\"\"> Fits <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md\">CONTRIBUTING.md</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add a 👍 <a href=\"https://github.blog/2016-03-10-add-reactions-to-pull-requests-issues-and-comments/\" rel=\"nofollow\">reaction</a> to <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pulls?q=is%3Aopen+sort%3Areactions-%2B1-desc\">pull requests you find important</a>.</p>",
